      "content": "thanks. it's just hard because everyone looks at me and thinks i'm so lucky. and i know i am, i really do. but inside it's just... dead. there's no color, no spark, nothing. it feels like i'm just a ghost going through the motions of a life that isn't even mine anymore. i just want the silence to be permanent. i want to stop feeling this nothingness.",
